{
    "background_story": "Deacon was an ancient sorcerer who had mastered the dark arts of serpent magic. According to legend, he had made a pact with a powerful serpent deity, trading his mortality for unimaginable power. As a result, Deacon possessed the ability to summon and control serpents at will. His followers believed that he could communicate with the ancient wisdom of the serpents, gaining insight into the mysteries of the universe. However, his enemies feared his ability to unleash venomous fangs and scales upon them. Deacon's true intentions were shrouded in mystery, but one thing was certain: his connection to the serpent realm made him a force to be reckoned with. Some said that on quiet nights, you could still hear the whispers of the serpents, guiding Deacon's every move.",
